        "landing.cta_crear" => "Create a free account",
        "landing.f1_text" => "From the 4 operations to fractions, equations, geometry and more.",
        "landing.f1_title" => "24 games",
        "landing.f2_text" => "Difficulty goes up and down on its own based on how they're doing.",
        "landing.f2_title" => "Adapts to each kid",
        "landing.f3_text" => "See progress, streaks and what to reinforce, per child.",
        "landing.f3_title" => "Parent dashboard",
        "landing.f4_text" => "One profile per child, with content for every age.",
        "landing.f4_title" => "Primary to secondary",
        "landing.f5_text" => "Install it as an app on your phone and play offline.",
        "landing.f5_title" => "Works offline",
        "landing.f6_text" => "No advertising, no in-game purchases. Peace of mind.",
        "landing.f6_title" => "No ads",
        "landing.f7_text" => "Every Monday you get an email summary of each child's progress.",
        "landing.f7_title" => "Weekly email reports",
        "landing.f8_text" => "Every calculation explained from scratch: what it's for, several methods by age, with drawings and even a bit of history.",
        "landing.f8_title" => "Learn, don't just practice",
        "landing.f9_text" => "Shortcuts to calculate faster in your head (friends of 10, ×9 with your hands, and more), then practice them by playing.",
        "landing.f9_title" => "Mental math tricks",
        "landing.features_title" => "Why MatHelp",
        "landing.final_text" => "Creating an account is free and takes a minute.",
        "landing.final_title" => "Ready to start?",
        "landing.hero_nota" => "Free. No ads. Takes a minute.",
        "landing.hero_sub" => "24 calculation games, from primary to secondary school. They adapt to each kid's level and you follow their progress.",
        "landing.hero_title" => "Math your kids actually want to practice",
        "landing.how_title" => "How to start",
        "landing.modo_familia_text" => "An adult creates the account and one profile per kid. Each one can sign in from their own device with their login, or pick their profile on a shared one. From the Family Zone you follow everyone's progress.",
        "landing.modo_familia_title" => "For your family",
        "landing.modo_solo_text" => "Create your account and start playing instantly. No profiles, no PIN: just log in and practice. Perfect if you're the one using MatHelp.",
        "landing.modo_solo_title" => "Just for you",
        "landing.modo_upgrade" => "Started solo and want to add your family? You can do it anytime from the app.",
        "landing.modos_sub" => "MatHelp works both ways.",
        "landing.modos_title" => "For you or the whole family?",
        "landing.perfiles_p1_text" => "Each member has their profile: their name, grade and own progress, all under the same account (the family email).",
        "landing.perfiles_p1_title" => "One profile per person",
        "landing.perfiles_p2_text" => "On a shared device, each one taps their profile to enter. And if a kid has their own phone, you give them a login to go straight in with their password.",
        "landing.perfiles_p2_title" => "Everyone gets to their own",
        "landing.perfiles_p3_text" => "An optional PIN keeps a sibling out of another's profile. From the Family Zone, with your adult PIN, you manage profiles and see everyone's progress.",
        "landing.perfiles_p3_title" => "Safe and tidy",
        "landing.perfiles_sub" => "One account, a profile for each person.",
        "landing.perfiles_title" => "How do profiles work?",
        "landing.step1_text" => "One account for the whole family, in a minute.",
        "landing.step1_title" => "Create the account",
        "landing.step2_text" => "One profile per child, with their name and grade.",
        "landing.step2_title" => "Add your kids",
        "landing.step3_text" => "Pick a game and practice. You follow everything from the dashboard.",
        "landing.step3_title" => "Start playing",
        "legal.actualizado" => "Last updated: September 2026.",
        "legal.contacto_texto" => "Questions about this? Write to us via",
        "legal.priv.cambios" => "We may update this policy; if there are important changes, you'll see them reflected on this page.",
        "legal.priv.datos" => "For the account: your email, your password (always hashed, never in plain text), the family name and the language. For each child's profile: name, avatar, birth year (to compute the age) and school grade. For activity: game sessions, answers and progress, to show stats and adapt difficulty.",
        "legal.priv.derechos" => "You can export all your family's data or delete the entire account whenever you want, from «My account». You can also recover your password if you forget it.",
        "legal.priv.h_cambios" => "Changes",
        "legal.priv.h_datos" => "What data we store",
        "legal.priv.h_derechos" => "Your rights",
        "legal.priv.h_menores" => "Children's data",
        "legal.priv.h_seguridad" => "Security",
        "legal.priv.h_uso" => "How we use it",
        "legal.priv.intro" => "At MatHelp we take care of your family's data. This policy explains what information we store and why. MatHelp is an educational app for practicing math as a family.",
        "legal.priv.menores" => "Children's profiles are created and managed by a responsible adult in the family. We ask for the minimum information needed and we do not share it with anyone.",
        "legal.priv.seguridad" => "Passwords are stored with Argon2 hashing and the session travels in an HttpOnly cookie. We do what's reasonable to protect your information, though no system is 100% foolproof.",
        "legal.priv.titulo" => "Privacy Policy",
        "legal.priv.uso" => "Only to run the app: show the profiles, save progress and adapt the exercises. We do not sell or share your data, we show no ads and we use no third-party trackers.",
        "legal.terms.cambios" => "We may modify or discontinue the service. You can delete your account at any time from «My account».",
        "legal.terms.cuenta" => "The account is created and managed by a responsible adult in the family. You are responsible for keeping your password safe and for the activity of your family's profiles.",
        "legal.terms.garantia" => "MatHelp is provided «as is», free of charge and without warranties. There may be interruptions or changes to features. We are not liable for losses arising from use of the app.",
        "legal.terms.h_cambios" => "Changes and cancellation",
        "legal.terms.h_cuenta" => "Your account",
        "legal.terms.h_garantia" => "No warranties",
        "legal.terms.h_uso" => "Acceptable use",
        "legal.terms.intro" => "By using MatHelp you accept these terms. It's a free app for practicing math as a family.",
